WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.240
You wake up in a train
carriage with no windows.

2
00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:06.810
The track is straight and
the ride perfectly smooth.

3
00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:10.530
No jolts, no sway, no engine noise.

4
00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:13.940
You might be moving
steadily, or standing still.

5
00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:19.290
On the bench: balls, a
pendulum, a stopwatch, a laser.

6
00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:22.370
Could any experiment
show that you are moving?

7
00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:24.860
In this mission, you'll
meet reference frames,

8
00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:27.330
and what makes a frame inertial.

9
00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:29.960
Then you'll see why the speed
of light forced Einstein,

10
00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:34.150
in 1905, to rethink time itself.

11
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.870
Your mission: decide whether any experiment
inside the train could reveal its

12
00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:41.090
steady motion, and explain why.
